{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{G}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0004": "$$\nK(\\textit{Mod}(\\mathcal{O}))\n\\longrightarrow\nK(\\textit{Mod}(\\mathcal{O})),\n\\quad\n\\mathcal{F}^\\bullet \\longmapsto\n\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{G}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{F}^\\bullet)\n$$", "MATH_0005": "$$\nK(\\textit{Mod}(\\mathcal{O}))\n\\longrightarrow\nK(\\textit{Mod}(\\mathcal{O})),\n\\quad\n\\mathcal{F}^\\bullet \\longmapsto\n\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{F}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{G}^\\bullet)\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-derived-tor-exact}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a058e33e5fd1bb2eef1f34a5c954f650ebd69f25d33835fed7ed5b15474f6c22", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:17a0c316dd6c6d79aac55c9912635d6114cfa1dd2f491f28119c1f7a19a2eba6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a complex of <MATH_0003>-modules.\nThe functors\n<MATH_0004>\nand\n<MATH_0005>\nare exact functors of triangulated categories.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9ebef11b0c7c3ddf30789f92ea315e8f18fb37d53afcddf7778a5eb5c9c633cb", "unit_id": "tag:06YM:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{derived-remark-double-complex-as-tensor-product-of}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2fdb52c51a155bbc04343fbd45fc8fa2da29d040ec027d246bb4f468cce8ab59", "source_text": "This follows from Derived Categories, Remark\n<REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ed659a2802884a6a4913deb79c27c2b8792d052efcd76bad80c06c78d9f79b1c", "unit_id": "tag:06YM:proof"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{F}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{F}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{K}^\\bullet)\n$$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-K-flat}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7e8fddba244f2a002e026c4d42faab18b87fe57515e869aa2caaea4a0975a828", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:42574f0e4c2bdac70c5f0a874b5682b5c9b08ca2e4352b5020cc15c427dc0ac0", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site.\nA complex <MATH_0002> of <MATH_0003>-modules is\ncalled <TEXTITOPEN_0001>K-flat<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if for every acyclic complex <MATH_0004>\nof <MATH_0005>-modules the complex\n<MATH_0006>\nis acyclic.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6d0895d96cece134c768be52da0fcff2523a860e9bd275bbd93328368536dd52", "unit_id": "tag:06YN:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0003": "$$\nK(\\textit{Mod}(\\mathcal{O}))\n\\longrightarrow\nK(\\textit{Mod}(\\mathcal{O})), \\quad\n\\mathcal{F}^\\bullet\n\\longmapsto\n\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{F}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{K}^\\bullet)\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-K-flat-quasi-isomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b8ce48092dc29c8a97ee73966b08b6411f7f3ca160a7dbf35c677e0efecd270b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d7b8fbd30d804dc0f9a8a83e3d0093cc704394d1264e2df1b23382957f57f9a8", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a K-flat complex.\nThen the functor\n<MATH_0003>\ntransforms quasi-isomorphisms into quasi-isomorphisms.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d956fb4621b6e3e06634eaf12362a1593ccf2f849500dca6a1fc57c30a748dde", "unit_id": "tag:06YP:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-derived-tor-exact}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fec620f7197de4d12b04ebc3c4a60abb0c4dbffad3a99952d488fe8af116be11", "source_text": "Follows from\nLemma <REF_0001>\nand the fact that quasi-isomorphisms are characterized by having\nacyclic cones.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:99d5f20b4ad9f12a747dbc3321d9ae631b52982650846fcf5a6d52d3286d8548", "unit_id": "tag:06YP:proof"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet|_U$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{O}_U$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-restriction-K-flat}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:634fa51634a367b8caa6d0050a21b5998c4eacde5881581441107efabaa1241e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ca7fbae3e1a34a19ee4a76e1f8d149e5f59259f943fbc1799bf4ab8c0477ee75", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an object of <MATH_0003>.\nIf <MATH_0004> is a K-flat complex of <MATH_0005>-modules, then\n<MATH_0006> is a K-flat complex of <MATH_0007>-modules.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e3be6ce765f418abd6b4263b235420f536dde7f3912e16e99ff3662ba76a264d", "unit_id": "tag:0E8K:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{G}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{O}_U$", "MATH_0003": "$j_{U!}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0006": "$$\nj_{U!}(\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{G}^\\bullet \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_U}\n\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet|_U)) =\n\\text{Tot}(j_{U!}\\mathcal{G}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{K}^\\bullet)\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$j_{U!}$", "MATH_0008": "$j_{U!}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-modules-lemma-extension-by-zero-exact}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{sites-modules-lemma-j-shriek-and-tensor}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{sites-modules-lemma-j-shriek-reflects-exactness}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e586e1ca3705394f4d8524629c9dbe4f8951544894214c232c72ffebc6171d13", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fa18b7d0df922c551811b1942857f853ca6e41ecf92851d17daf5a74e2e04122", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an exact complex of <MATH_0002>-modules.\nSince <MATH_0003> is exact\n(Modules on Sites, Lemma <REF_0001>)\nand <MATH_0004> is a K-flat complex of <MATH_0005>-modules\nwe see that the complex\n<MATH_0006>\nis exact. Here the equality comes from\nModules on Sites, Lemma <REF_0002>\nand the fact that <MATH_0007> commutes with direct sums (as a left adjoint).\nWe conclude because <MATH_0008> reflects exactness by\nModules on Sites, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:26b457340a1be4ee22b237228d54a7fd72960195d28a297b7acb029ec6e35d5e", "unit_id": "tag:0E8K:proof"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\mathcal{C}, \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{L}^\\bullet$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{L}^\\bullet)$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-tensor-product-K-flat}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b6fde2eb3233fc5ae23a01a341dab1ba0e36747408ed4e1a44f2ed45d612a2e7", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cd528fa62b7f79c29bb9ea874c3a3d2f1da2184b1edb4c040934f2552c6b760b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed site.\nIf <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> are K-flat complexes\nof <MATH_0004>-modules, then\n<MATH_0005>\nis a K-flat complex of <MATH_0006>-modules.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5204c93669676ad985d7bd7d2e66eaae2d338e504e66bbbead64a9a3ffcd8914", "unit_id": "tag:07A2:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{M}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O}\n\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{L}^\\bullet))\n=\n\\text{Tot}(\\text{Tot}(\\mathcal{M}^\\bullet \\otimes_\\mathcal{O}\n\\mathcal{K}^\\bullet) \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{L}^\\bullet)\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9ac3c2bb7bdabac27144913b06609da229de50056f6b6ef32c262c5950ecc610", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2499f297e6fd68a444d4341352ddc1f3ee8c2fb621d1ad2c6ccad9995730cc11", "source_text": "Follows from the isomorphism\n<MATH_0001>\nand the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:eb9e93d1d6e4e77ef2038000e15fa245861c4b361c7c7cb4f8b93c3d90a5785d", "unit_id": "tag:07A2:proof"}
